# Next.js

- This Next.js version differs from training data: check `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` (see AGENTS.md) before using an unfamiliar API — read only the relevant guide.
- App Router; Server Components by default. Add `"use client"` only for interactivity (forms, seat/room pickers).
- All data via `lib/api.ts` (mock fallback in `lib/mock.ts`); merchant/tenant branding via `lib/merchant.ts`. No fetches in components outside these.
- Types in `lib/types.ts`. Tailwind utilities + shared `components/ui.tsx`; brand colors from CSS vars in `app/globals.css`.
- Responsive, mobile-first. Bangla/English text; Bangla digits for display, ASCII to the API.
- Verify with `npm run lint` (and `npx tsc --noEmit`) rather than a full `next build`.
